WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.000
Overtaken by evil, Aknadin transformed into Great Shadow Magus.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:41.910
He wanted his son Seto to be Zorc's new Pharaoh, so he killed Kisara.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:45.120
But Kisara transformed into a white dragon to protect Seto.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:48.560
And Seto was able to defeat the evil.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.840
But The Hourglass of Evil has run out.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.830
Zorc's resurrection has begun!

00:01:54.830 --> 00:02:00.840
Zorc Resurrects

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:12.010
The Duel Disk's deck will contain 40 cards that you think of.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.860
But you won't know the order until you draw.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.540
So I think up my deck?

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:29.100
You probably know this, but this duel will be a Shadow Game.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:33.420
Whoever loses all their life points will die.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.020
Don’t do it, Yugi!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.760
This duel is too dangerous!

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.880
Wait a sec, Bakura!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.940
What did you do with Honda?

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.340
Honda?

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.380
I possessed his body.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.900
And I’ve been spying on you.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.260
So that’s what happened.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.520
That’s dirty!

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.960
Give Honda back!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:06.900
If you want him back, beat me in a duel.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.100
Honda...

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.120
Here I go, Yugi!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.740
Duel!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.080
This way!  Hurry!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:34.520
Karim!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.560
Isis, we have to go!

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.640
Karim!

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.900
Thank you, Mana.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.360
Serves you right!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.780
Bakura!

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:58.220
There’s nowhere left to escape!

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.540
That’s...

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.100
The tablet of the afterlife!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.700
Your lives are over.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.980
Come forth, Zorc!

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.500
That’s...

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.440
What?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:54.440
That’s Zorc!

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.900
It finally resurrected.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.700
The character I control has switched to Zorc!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.880
Your priests are no match!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.820
Destroy the city as much as you like!

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:16.000
Burn the humans to a crisp!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:24.680
If Zorc’s dark powers are released, this world will be annihilated.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:30.680
I've woken from my long slumber to destroy everything.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:35.140
No one can stop me.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:40.680
I will burn everyone alive with the flames of hell!

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:43.620
Zorc Inferno!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.320
Hasan!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.120
Leave this to me.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.480
Everyone, flee!

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.940
But...

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:05.440
Return to the palace and protect the city!

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.740
Hurry!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:14.560
You're foolish to oppose me.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.700
Everyone is powerless against me.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.320
Pharaoh...

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:35.560
Zorc has finally arrived.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.700
What?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:42.700
Luckily, this tomb is protected by a magical barrier, so Zorc can't attack.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.660
So we can enjoy our duel.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:46.900
Yugi!

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:49.460
Good luck!  Don’t lose!

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:55.440
Since Zorc has resurrected, there’s only one hope left.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.490
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:04.660
I have to tell my other self his real name and seal Zorc away again.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.120
So I can't afford to lose!

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.980
I set a card.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:14.400
Then I set a monster in defense position and end my turn.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.760
You're playing passive.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.360
It's my turn.  I draw!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.480
You can't defeat me if you play like that!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:30.120
I summon Doomcaliber Knight!

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.580
I attack your set monster!

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:39.640
Marshmallon’s effect activates!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:44.080
By attacking it, you take 1000 damage!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:49.020
And Marshmallon can't be destroyed in battle!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.480
What an annoying card.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:58.740
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.420
Zorc is heading towards the city!

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.180
What?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.620
Hurry!  We can't let it reach the city!

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.420
Zorc has finally appeared.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.860
So that’s the great evil you mentioned.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:40.600
Kisara, lend me your strength.

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:49.800
Pharaoh!

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:53.020
Kaiba, what will you do?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:57.500
I told you that you can't order me around.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.410
Do what you want.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:21.020
How strange...  You seem the same as Seto.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.800
I sense we’ll meet again.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.700
Shimon!  Shada!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.080
The Pharaoh’s returned!

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:11.100
Pharaoh!

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.340
Pharaoh, you’re safe!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.780
Seto!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.000
You’re safe.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.500
Sorry to make you worry.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.700
What about Aknadin?

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.700
Aknadin perished.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.880
What?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.160
Seto is now safe.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.260
Pharaoh...

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.220
Zorc is coming!

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:30.870
Are we rea-

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:32.480
Pharaoh!

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:37.400
Pharaoh, you don't have much Ba left.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:42.000
Leave this to me so I can reclaim my honor.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.420
You're in charge, Seto.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.800
It's coming!

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.800
Soldiers!  Get ready!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.920
Don’t let it take a single step inside the city!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.960
Defend it with your lives!

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.600
For the Pharaoh!

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:18.500
The deck I imagined is a completely new deck that I've never played before.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.180
Just wait, my other self.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:24.500
I promise to defeat Bakura with this deck!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.100
And bring your real name to you!

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.320
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.960
I set one card!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:04.360
From my hand, I summon Silent Swordsman LV0 in attack position!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.700
Marshmallon and Silent Swordsman...

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.700
I’ve never seen those monsters before.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.640
He's using a completely new deck.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:20.080
I thought you used Marshmallon for defense to wait for an opening.

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:22.740
But you summoned another weak monster.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.200
What are you planning?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.260
I flip over my set card!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.630
Marshmallon Glasses!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:38.150
The monster wearing Marshmallon Glasses can only attack Marshmallon!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.510
Stop being annoying!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.680
I end my turn!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.440
That strategy won’t work on me!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:50.160
It’s my turn!  I draw!

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:55.030
A vessel without the Pharaoh is garbage.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.460
I activate the spell card, Negate Defense!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.630
It switches Marshmallon to attack position!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.710
Take this!

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:07.130
Doomcaliber Knight attacks Marshmallon!

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:17.180
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.320
Fire!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.790
Unbelievable!

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.410
Keep firing!

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.300
You worms...

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.510
Stop, Bakura!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.890
What for?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.040
What?

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.380
What's happening?

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:27.250
What's happening in the Shadow Game world is linking to the real world.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.910
What do you mean?

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.920
This is why it's the ultimate Shadow Game.

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:37.850
Even I couldn't predict this, but it’s working in my favor.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:46.870
I wanted to learn your real name - which is the 8th key - to resurrect Zorc in the real world.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:50.000
But I don’t have to anymore.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:56.000
I'll bury both the memory world and the real world in darkness!

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.550
I must reseal Zorc!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:16.520
At this rate...

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:20.400
Seto, let’s retreat and rebuild our forces!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.850
That fiend...

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.340
Retreat!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.160
Save me, Mama!

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:36.880
I don’t want to die!

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:39.500
Good!  Keep attacking!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.330
Keep destroying!

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:46.160
Bakura!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.090
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:53.270
Silent Swordsman becomes Level 1!

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:58.200
So Silent Swordsman levels up every turn.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.520
It has 1500 attack points.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:04.860
It can’t destroy Doomcaliber Knight because it has 1900 attack points.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.450
In that case...

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:07.890
It’s my Battle Phase!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:11.750
Hold up!  When you enter the Battle Phase...

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.060
...I can activate this!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.190
The trap card, Call of the Earthbound!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:26.630
Call of the Earthbound forces Silent Swordsman to attack a monster of my choosing.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.570
Then I activate another trap card.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:34.740
I Special Summon the trap monster, Zoma the Spirit in defense position!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.510
Silent Swordsman, attack Zoma the Spirit!

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:45.640
Why is he forcing it to attack his defending monster?

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:51.280
If he forced it to attack Doomcaliber Knight, Silent Swordsman will be destroyed.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:52.770
Think harder.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:59.360
When Zoma the Spirit is destroyed, Zoma changes into ectoplasm.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:08.680
And you take damage equal to double the attack points of the monster that destroyed Zoma.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:19.350
So you take double of Silent Swordsman’s attack points as damage - 3000 points!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.880
Yugi has 2400 life points!

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:26.530
Oh no!  Bakura wants to end him this turn!

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:29.860
This was the true goal of my trap combo.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.200
Die!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:33.600
Yugi!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.940
I was waiting for this moment!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.550
No way!  My ectoplasm!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:45.990
I activated the spell card, Turn Jump!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.640
Turn Jump?

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:54.340
This turn’s Battle Phase was skipped, negating Zoma the Spirit’s effect.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:57.380
And that’s not all!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.400
What?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:10.310
Silent Swordsman is now Level 4!

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:14.240
3000 attack points?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:17.510
Here goes!  Silent Swordsman attacks!

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:20.360
Silent Sword Level 4!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.530
Doomcaliber Knight is destroyed!

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.330
It's powerful!

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:33.230
Yugi!

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:38.320
Then Marshmallon attacks you directly!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:43.940
I end my turn.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.860
You’re awesome, Yugi!

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:53.540
Come to think of it, the duelist who's been batting until now was the other Yugi.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:19:02.320
But to save the other Yugi, Yugi is facing the enemy alone with his own deck!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.670
Keep going, Yugi!

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:09.600
Not too bad, for a vessel.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:19.600
If we don’t defeat Zorc, this world will be engulfed in darkness.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:24.480
And we'll never escape the shadows for eternity.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.350
We priests will release all our Kas!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.760
Spiria!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:41.290
I summon Two-Headed Jackal Warrior!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.080
Duos!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:50.540
You fools still oppose me?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.740
Aura Force!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.780
Master, lend me your power!

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.120
Magical Shockwave!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.730
You don't know when to surrender.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.620
Die, you worms!

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:18.100
That fiend!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:21.030
What destructive power!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.700
C'mon.  This game isn't fun if it's one-sided.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:32.960
I thought you'd be more of a challenge, but I overestimated you.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.640
Bakura, you fiend!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:37.590
I'll just end this game.

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:40.950
Pharaoh!

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.700
The end.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.560
Shada!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.820
Pharaoh...

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:54.020
Hang in there!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:57.720
I’m glad... you’re safe...

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.170
Shada...

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.820
Shada!

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.990
Your loyal minion saved you.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.510
You punk!

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:15.920
But all he did was prolong your agony.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:18.140
Give up, Yugi.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.850
It’s too late to do anything.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:26.800
In this Shadow Game, your odds of winning is 0.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.020
Shada...

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:37.110
Is there really nothing I can do?

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:16.200
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:31.920
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:37.760
Without a goal in mind

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:46.330
We just step towards our dream

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:51.970
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:52.160 --> 00:23:00.440
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.800 --> 00:23:06.250
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:14.390
Will touch your soul

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:17.650
In a duel

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:32.180
Zorc has finally resurrected.

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.970
It's too powerful!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.490
Give it your all, Yugi!

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:40.530
You have to defeat Bakura and give the Pharaoh his name.

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:43.080
Or Zorc will destroy this world!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:50.680
To fight back against Zorc, the Pharaoh wants to retrieve the Millennium Items.

00:23:50.970 --> 00:23:54.730
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Legendary Protector
Exodia Resurrects!

00:23:54.730 --> 00:23:56.320
Duel, standby!
